1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,050
Have you ever fancied sailing around the world in your own yacht or buying a holiday home in the Caribbean?
你是否曾经幻想过驾驶着自己的游艇环游世界，或者在加勒比海地区购买一处度假屋呢？

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:13,420
Well, before you get too excited, it may help to find out if you have what it takes to become a billionaire.
嗯，在你过于兴奋之前，先搞清楚一下自己是否具备成为亿万富翁的条件可能会有所帮助。

3
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:21,530
We've all heard stories of school drop-outs who have made their fortune, but are they the norm or an exception to the rule?
我们都听过一些辍学者发家致富的故事，但他们是常态还是例外情况呢？

4
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:26,220
Do they tend to be university graduates or self-made entrepreneurs?
他们更倾向于是大学毕业生还是白手起家的企业家呢？

5
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,940
Are they married or single?
他们是已婚还是单身呢？

6
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:38,650
Thanks to a recent analysis of people in Forbes Top 100 Billionaires List, we can now find out what the world's mega rich have in common.
多亏了最近对《福布斯》全球富豪百强榜上的人进行的一项分析，我们现在可以了解到世界上的超级富豪们有哪些共同之处。

7
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:47,130
We know which star sign is the most popular amongst multi-millionaires, what percentage wear glasses and even how many are bald!
我们知道在千万富翁中哪个星座最普遍，戴眼镜的人占多大比例，甚至还知道有多少人是秃头！

8
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:56,160
If you are deciding whether or not to go to university, it may help you to know that 76% of the richest people in the world have a degree.
如果你正在决定是否要上大学，了解到世界上76%的最富有的人都拥有一个学位可能会对你有所帮助。

9
00:00:56,160 --> 00:01:06,820
According to this study, of those 76%, 47% have a bachelor's degree, 23% have a master's and 6% have a doctorate.
根据这项研究，在这76%的人中，47%拥有学士学位，23%拥有硕士学位，6%拥有博士学位。

10
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:10,310
Don't lose hope if you aren't very academic though.
不过，如果你不太擅长学术方面也不要失去希望。

11
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:15,760
It's worth noting that many of those on the list did not pass all their exams with flying colours.
值得注意的是，榜单上的许多人并没有以优异的成绩通过所有考试。

12
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:21,830
Microsoft founder Bill Gates dropped out of Harvard University after two years of study.
微软创始人比尔·盖茨在哈佛大学学习两年后就辍学了。

13
00:01:21,830 --> 00:01:31,790
And Chinese business magnate Jack Ma, failed his university entrance exams three times before going on to complete his degree and make his millions.
而中国商业巨头马云，在完成学位并赚取数百万财富之前，曾三次高考落榜。

14
00:01:31,790 --> 00:01:40,890
Another interesting trend is that the world's high-fliers are much more likely to be married - only 12% of billionaires are unmarried.
另一个有趣的趋势是，世界上的成功人士更有可能是已婚人士——只有12%的亿万富翁是未婚的。

15
00:01:40,890 --> 00:01:50,780
You are also more likely to make it if you were born under the most popular star sign, Aquarius, than if you are a Cancer - the least popular sign on the zodiac.
而且，如果你出生在最受欢迎的星座水瓶座，你成功的可能性要比出生在巨蟹座的人更大。

16
00:01:50,780 --> 00:02:01,580
Finally, the percentage of billionaires who are bald is quite high - so don't worry if you're losing your hair, you may get to sail that yacht around the Caribbean after all!
最后，亿万富翁中秃头的比例相当高——所以如果你正在掉头发，也不要担心，你毕竟有可能驾驶着游艇在加勒比海地区航行的！
